5,0,1,talk,Toshio,,"Let us begin. To identify the werewolf efficiently, we must decide if the Seer should reveal themselves early or remain hidden to avoid being targeted.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Misaki,,Revealing the Seer early provides clear direction but makes them a target. A balanced approach is more efficient.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Mizuki,,"Logic suggests that a hidden Seer provides more long-term value. If the Seer is killed immediately, we lose our only objective source of truth.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Minato,,I think everyone is saying something important. I'll go along with whatever the group thinks is safest for everyone.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Jonathan,,It is a delicate balance. I will be observing how we all react to these suggestions; the truth often hides in the subtle shifts of tone.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Minato, your passivity is noted. @Jonathan, observation is useful, but we need a concrete strategy. I suggest we look for contradictions in speech patterns.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Minato"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Misaki,,"Agreed. Consistency is key. If someone changes their stance without new information, it is a red flag.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Mizuki,,"While consistency is important, we must be careful not to mistake nervousness for guilt. Let's focus on logical inconsistencies rather than mere demeanor.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Minato,,I agree with Mizuki. It would be sad if we blamed someone just because they were nervous.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Jonathan,,A gentle reminder that pressure can make anyone seem suspicious. Let us remain calm and patient with one another.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Toshio,,"Emotional appeals are irrelevant. We should prioritize data. If the Seer remains hidden, we must rely on voting patterns and behavioral analysis.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Misaki,,"@Toshio, while data is important, ignoring the human element entirely is inefficient. We should combine both logical analysis and behavioral observation.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Mizuki,,"Exactly. However, we must ensure that our ""observations"" are not just subjective biases. We need a standard for what constitutes ""suspicious"" behavior.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Minato,,I think Misaki and Mizuki are both right. Maybe we can try to do both?,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Misaki"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Jonathan,,I find the tension here interesting. The way some of you push for cold logic while others seek empathy tells a story of its own.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Toshio,,"We have established the trade-offs. For now, we proceed with caution. I will observe your responses to the first night's results.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
21,0,4,pass,Toshio,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
22,0,4,talk,Misaki,,I will focus on the consistency of the arguments presented tomorrow. Let's be precise.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,0,4,talk,Mizuki,,I will be analyzing the flow of the conversation. Let us see who tries too hard to lead the narrative.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,0,4,talk,Minato,,I hope we can all get along and find the werewolf peacefully.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
25,0,4,talk,Jonathan,,I shall continue to listen to the silence between your words. Good night to you all.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
26,0,,action,Toshio,Jonathan,HUMAN,"{""action"":""divine"",""result"":""HUMAN"",""valid"":true,""raw"":"" Jonathan (human)""}"
